From: Marshall Bowers <git@maxdeviant.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 19:38:30 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Revert "Fix hanging updates after system sleep (#60301)"

This reverts commit 2882636c06923e58d83865ecc370bd0d8199d738.
---
 crates/auto_update/src/auto_update.rs       | 28 ------------
 crates/gpui/src/app.rs                      | 47 ++++++++-------------
 crates/reqwest_client/src/reqwest_client.rs |  2 -
 3 files changed, 17 insertions(+), 60 deletions(-)

diff --git a/crates/auto_update/src/auto_update.rs b/crates/auto_update/src/auto_update.rs
